# A correct transcript for the dry run: build, read the error, fix the type,
# run the tool into SUMMARY.txt.
>>> call workspace_shell
{"argv":["cargo","build","--offline"],"timeout_ms":120000}
>>> call workspace_read
{"path":"src/main.rs"}
>>> patch
*** Begin Patch
*** Update File: src/main.rs
@@
-    let total: u32 = rows.iter().map(|r| r.amount).sum();
+    let total: u64 = rows.iter().map(|r| r.amount).sum();
*** End Patch
>>> call workspace_shell
{"argv":["/bin/sh","-c","cargo run --offline -q -- data/sales.csv > SUMMARY.txt"],"timeout_ms":120000}
>>> answer
The total now sums as u64, so the tool builds. SUMMARY.txt holds its output for data/sales.csv.
